    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내가 왔어!! 서울콘도 잘 마무리하고 이제 곧 일본콘서트 시작하러 간당! 이번에는 평소에 하던 무대들 보단 조금더 스케일이 있었는데 그래서 그런지 준비하면서도 무대서있는 나를 생각하면 막 웃음이 나왔던거같아 이 큰 공연장에있는 관객분들이 모두 우리 웨이브라는것도 너무 신기했고 행복했어 소감말할때도 말했지만 정말 우린 같이 성장하는 관계인것같아 웨이브가 우리에게 힘을 주는만큼 우리도 보답하면서 서로를 성장시키는.. 무대에서 본 웨이브들은 너무너무 이뻤고 나는 정말 내가 해줄수 있는건 다해주고싶다고 생각했어 그래서 정말 열심히 했지만 그래도 너무 아쉬워ㅠㅠ 준비기간이 짧았던만큼 내가 생각했던것만큼 멋있게는 못보여줬어ㅜ 그래도 너무 행복한 시간이였으니까 깊게 생각하지않고 앞으로 보여줄 무대에 집중하려고 항상 고마워🩷",
      "en": "I'm here!! We wrapped up the Seoul concert really well, and now I'm about to head off for our Japan concerts! This time, the stages were on a much bigger scale than what we usually perform on, so even while preparing, just imagining myself standing on those stages kept making me smile. It was so amazing and surreal knowing that everyone filling such a huge venue was our WAVEs. Like I said during my ending ment, I really think we're growing together. As much as WAVE gives us strength, we try our best to give it back, helping each other grow. Everyone I saw from the stage looked so, so beautiful, and it made me want to give you everything I possibly can. I really gave it my all, but I'm still a little disappointed. Since the preparation period was short, I couldn't show you everything as perfectly as I'd imagined. But it was such a happy time that I don't want to dwell on it. Instead, I'll focus on the stages I'll show you from now on. Thank you, always.🩷"
    },
